# Build context is the repository root: send only what the backend image needs (allow-list). The deny-all keeps
# environment files, the Git directory and node_modules out of the context and so out of every layer.
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/app
!packages/schedule-policy/pyproject.toml
!packages/schedule-policy/schedule_policy
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
